regress/fbctrl_port_probe.py:64:REG = dict(zr=0, v0=2, v1=3, a0=4, a1=5, a2=6, a3=7, t0=8, t1=9, t2=10, t3=11, t4=12, t5=13, t6=14, t7=15,
regress/fbctrl_port_probe.py:65:           s0=16, s1=17, s2=18, s3=19, s4=20, s5=21, s6=22, s7=23, t8=24, t9=25)
