codex
The shell block rejects missing summaries and exact duplicate markers, but it accepts an extra malformed DONE line alongside a valid one. The probe also checks first-refusal logging only for selector 9, preserves only selectors 5 and 7 by readback, and never checks warning scope across instances in one process. I’ll distinguish those coverage limits from faults in the current device code.
